; MaxProfit_Gold_3Y
; Gold (XAUUSD) M15 Order Blocks -> M1 CISD, trading ENABLED, 0.01 lots.
;
; Best risk-adjusted result of 128 configurations tested over three years
; (2023-10-01 to 2026-10-01) with this broker spread:
;   profit +809.57   trades 92   win rate 43.5%
;   profit factor 2.11   recovery factor 5.85   max drawdown 138.38
;   longest losing run 5
;
; Year by year: -29.83 / +216.48 / +622.92
; It LOST money in the first year. No configuration tested was profitable in
; all three, so treat this as a setting that works in trending gold and bleeds
; in quiet markets, not as an all-weather edge.

